WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 13.3 · Strategy to Action: Plan, Deliver & Review
Deliverables and acceptance

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Define what “done” means, and who accepts it, before the work starts.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Each deliverable supports a priority or KPI.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Write acceptance criteria someone else can check.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Include review time, not just drafting time.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio: an agreement signed by all 8 employers, requiring a written contract and health insurance. Lucía accepts it.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write deliverables with acceptance criteria and a reviewer.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
